Full evaluation. No API key, deterministic offline reader

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Guardrails trained on 546 injection and 1,044 jailbreak examples

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.500
Release gate: recall@5 0.908, MRR 0.825, ECE 0.044

